{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS DEMO INCLUDES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 spells</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 levels from the campaign</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL GAME INCLUDES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more than <strong>30 spells</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >full campaign (story mode)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>roguelike mode</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >choose <strong>upgrades</strong> (new spells, health, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fight <strong>waves of enemies</strong></p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROL THE ELEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the elemental resources bend to your will. Transform the flames of a forest into a blazing fireball, or cause lakes to vanish, rising mist that cloaks the world in shadow. Strategize ahead, shaping the environment to your advantage, and combine resources to cast devastating spells.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955070/extras/5be6ca573f69f7971c47dbb03268d7c4.poster.avif?t=1761241721\" width=780 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955070/extras/5be6ca573f69f7971c47dbb03268d7c4.webm?t=1761241721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955070/extras/5be6ca573f69f7971c47dbb03268d7c4.mp4?t=1761241721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT SPELL CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose wisely from the cards that come your way.\u00a0Discover endless combinations and utilities for each spell card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955070/extras/f7db9813d0d02db746a13fa7ba34b29a.avif?t=1761241721\" width=1260 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REACT TO YOUR FOES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of your surroundings, for the world is full of both danger and opportunity. Turn-based combat gives you the chance to react to opponents\u2019 spells or plan ahead, layering spells for unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955070/extras/177fa67884a50a121196f37e9f5a3981.poster.avif?t=1761241721\" width=630 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955070/extras/177fa67884a50a121196f37e9f5a3981.webm?t=1761241721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955070/extras/177fa67884a50a121196f37e9f5a3981.mp4?t=1761241721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use hexagonal tiles with elemental resources (fire, water, wood, stone, and air) to cast powerful spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the environment to your advantage by manipulating the natural elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast devastating spells to overcome foul creatures and obstacles in your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your moves in strategic turn-based combat to outwit enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new spell cards for endless strategic possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a cursed land and encounter mysterious figures on your journey.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955070?t=1761241721","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955070?t=1761241721","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955070/7b2b4a943664f6b9e227a6d6fc4f66c5e88b4f80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761241721","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955070/7b2b4a943664f6b9e227a6d6fc4f66c5e88b4f80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761241721","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS DEMO INCLUDES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 spells</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 levels from the campaign</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL GAME INCLUDES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more than <strong>30 spells</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >full campaign (story mode)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>roguelike mode</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >choose <strong>upgrades</strong> (new spells, health, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fight <strong>waves of enemies</strong></p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROL THE ELEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the elemental resources bend to your will. Transform the flames of a forest into a blazing fireball, or cause lakes to vanish, rising mist that cloaks the world in shadow. Strategize ahead, shaping the environment to your advantage, and combine resources to cast devastating spells.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955070/extras/5be6ca573f69f7971c47dbb03268d7c4.poster.avif?t=1761241721\" width=780 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955070/extras/5be6ca573f69f7971c47dbb03268d7c4.webm?t=1761241721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955070/extras/5be6ca573f69f7971c47dbb03268d7c4.mp4?t=1761241721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT SPELL CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose wisely from the cards that come your way.\u00a0Discover endless combinations and utilities for each spell card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955070/extras/f7db9813d0d02db746a13fa7ba34b29a.avif?t=1761241721\" width=1260 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REACT TO YOUR FOES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of your surroundings, for the world is full of both danger and opportunity. Turn-based combat gives you the chance to react to opponents\u2019 spells or plan ahead, layering spells for unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955070/extras/177fa67884a50a121196f37e9f5a3981.poster.avif?t=1761241721\" width=630 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955070/extras/177fa67884a50a121196f37e9f5a3981.webm?t=1761241721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955070/extras/177fa67884a50a121196f37e9f5a3981.mp4?t=1761241721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use hexagonal tiles with elemental resources (fire, water, wood, stone, and air) to cast powerful spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the environment to your advantage by manipulating the natural elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast devastating spells to overcome foul creatures and obstacles in your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your moves in strategic turn-based combat to outwit enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new spell cards for endless strategic possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a cursed land and encounter mysterious figures on your journey.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Catilian Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2957870","name":"Urok"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955070/518bec50982e23a28278ae4e21df5900dd7d2384/header.jpg?t=1761241721","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3955070/1220252324/29e763d49ff7ba961c6b9d83d5ed1ed7dcc25c9e/1755162896/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760974134","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3955070/1220252324/29e763d49ff7ba961c6b9d83d5ed1ed7dcc25c9e/1755162896/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760974134","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3955070/1220252324/29e763d49ff7ba961c6b9d83d5ed1ed7dcc25c9e/1755162896/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760974134","id":257183046,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183046/movie480.mp4?t=1760974134","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183046/movie_max.mp4?t=1760974134"},"name":"Urok Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store